            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AntKathy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I am enjoying a solitary evening of \"recipe roaming\", and planned on having a glass of wine. However, I came across this recipe, and decided it looked too Strawberrylicious to pass up. I cut the recipe to serve one (ok, two), and am enjoying it now! I'm a big fan of strawberry &amp; pineapple combinations for smoothies, and let me tell you, the lime juice really adds a lot to brightening up the flavors in this daquiri. I did use some frozen pineapple in addition to the juice, as I had just a bit left over from something else. I elimitated the ice since the frozen fruit served that purpose. Mmm! Strawberrylicious is right! Enjoy!"
          },
